  "warning": "Backchannel and barge-in fields are automatic candidates and require human acceptance for gold labels.",
  "turns": [
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0001",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 0.54,
      "end_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Oak Street Pharmacy. This is Aaron. How can I help you?",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0002",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 4.18,
      "end_seconds": 13.69,
      "text": "Hey, um, uh, I'm calling about a prescription that was supposed to be ready this afternoon. Um, the app still, still says it's, um, being processed. I was wondering if you knew anything about that.",
      "word_count": 37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0003",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 14.72,
      "end_seconds": 18.439,
      "text": "Okay. I can check the status. What's your name and date of birth?",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.719,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0004",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 19.1,
      "end_seconds": 23.22,
      "text": "Um, Miles Carter. June 14th, uh, 1988.",
      "word_count": 7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0005",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 24.6,
      "end_seconds": 24.96,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.36,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0006",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 26.42,
      "end_seconds": 28.06,
      "text": "And which medication are you expecting?",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0007",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 28.9,
      "end_seconds": 34.019,
      "text": "Um, the inhaler, uh, Albuterol. I think, um, my doctor should have sent it this morning.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.119,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0008",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 35.2,
      "end_seconds": 36.3,
      "text": "All right. Give me a moment.",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0009",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 44.82,
      "end_seconds": 50.6,
      "text": "I see the prescription. It's with me. It came in at ten forty-two but it stopped at the insurance step.",
      "word_count": 22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0010",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 52.18,
      "end_seconds": 59.55,
      "text": "Um, what did-- what do you mean, uh, insurance? The app didn't say anything about insurance or anything. It just said, um, that it was processing. Did I miss something?",
      "word_count": 31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.37,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0011",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 60.38,
      "end_seconds": 71.98,
      "text": "Um, yeah, so the app message is pretty general. The claim rejected because the plan thinks that the refill is too soon. Did you by any chance have or fill another inhaler recently?",
      "word_count": 33,
      "duration_seconds": 11.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0012",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 73.36,
      "end_seconds": 83.54,
      "text": "Um, I, I think, I think I did it, uh, last month, but I left that one in a h- hotel room and I told the doctor's office that, um, when I was asking for, uh, for a refill.",
      "word_count": 40,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0013",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 84.6,
      "end_seconds": 85.78,
      "text": "Okay. Give me one moment.",
      "word_count": 5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0014",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 89.56,
      "end_seconds": 99.74,
      "text": "The new prescription is valid. I'm seeing that the issue here is the payment. We can ask the insurance for a lost medication override, but they may need to speak with you.",
      "word_count": 33,
      "duration_seconds": 10.18,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0015",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 99.84,
      "end_seconds": 104.9,
      "text": "Uh, is there any way you can call them right now? I'm leaving town again tomorrow morning a- and I kinda need it.",
      "word_count": 24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0016",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 106.02,
      "end_seconds": 112.759,
      "text": "Okay. I can start it. One second. Before I do, do you need the inhaler tonight or do you have another one available with you?",
      "word_count": 25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.739,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0017",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 113.54,
      "end_seconds": 119.06,
      "text": "Uh, I got, I got one at home with, um, maybe a f- a couple doses left, but I need the new one before I go on the trip.",
      "word_count": 29,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0018",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 120.22,
      "end_seconds": 120.68,
      "text": "Understood.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0019",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 122.12,
      "end_seconds": 126.6,
      "text": "Let me call the plan while you're on the line. It may take a couple minutes. Okay?",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0020",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 126.66,
      "end_seconds": 127.12,
      "text": "Yeah. Thank you.",
      "word_count": 3,
      "duration_seconds": 0.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0021",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 141.04,
      "end_seconds": 186.5,
      "text": "Thank you for holding.",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 45.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0022",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 187.4,
      "end_seconds": 187.53,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.13,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0023",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 187.53,
      "end_seconds": 195.46,
      "text": "They approved a one-time lost medication override. I reran the claim and I'm seeing that your co-pay is fifteen dollars.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 7.93,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0024",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 196.4,
      "end_seconds": 198.74,
      "text": "Okay. Um, great. So is it, is it ready now?",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0025",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 199.72,
      "end_seconds": 208.14,
      "text": "Um, not quite yet. The pharmacist on our side still has to check it. You're next in the queue, and we're looking at about thirty minutes.",
      "word_count": 28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0026",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 208.26,
      "end_seconds": 213.48,
      "text": "Um, when do you guys close? It closes at, on the pharmacy, it's at, um, seven, right? Like it closes at seven?",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0027",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 214.32,
      "end_seconds": 219.19,
      "text": "Our counter closes at seven but the front store usually stays a lot open. Uh, open a lot later.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0028",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 220.38,
      "end_seconds": 225.87,
      "text": "Right. So it's, it's like, um, six fifteen now and I'm about twenty-five minutes away. Is that,",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0029",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 227.14,
      "end_seconds": 228.64,
      "text": "is that, is that good? Is that fine?",
      "word_count": 8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0030",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 229.68,
      "end_seconds": 237.1,
      "text": "Okay. Well, I think if you leave after you get the ready text you should make it. I don't wanna tell you to come before the pharmacist finishes the check though.",
      "word_count": 32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0031",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 238.04,
      "end_seconds": 244.12,
      "text": "Yeah. No, no, yeah. I, I get it. Uh, can you, can you make sure it doesn't get pushed to tomorrow though? Is that possible?",
      "word_count": 26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0032",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 244.18,
      "end_seconds": 245.43,
      "text": "Yeah, I can flag-",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0033",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 245.43,
      "end_seconds": 245.43,
      "text": "Sorry.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.0,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0034",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 245.43,
      "end_seconds": 254.54,
      "text": "Yeah. All good. I can flag it on my end that you're traveling and waiting for it tonight. I can't skip the pharmacist's verification, but it is already in the active queue.",
      "word_count": 35,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0035",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 255.72,
      "end_seconds": 261.399,
      "text": "Oh, okay. That, that's great. Uh, what happens if I don't get the text by say like six forty-five or something like that?",
      "word_count": 26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.679,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0036",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 262.12,
      "end_seconds": 272.54,
      "text": "Okay. Um, I would just call us back before you drive over. If there is a delay we can tell you whether another Oak Street location has it in stock, but we'd have to transfer the prescription.",
      "word_count": 38,
      "duration_seconds": 10.42,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0037",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 273.34,
      "end_seconds": 277.7,
      "text": "And does that one also close at, on the counter at seven or is it, is it later?",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0038",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 279.7,
      "end_seconds": 284.56,
      "text": "The Park Avenue store closes at nine I believe. Let me check their stock so we know the backup.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0039",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 289.22,
      "end_seconds": 296.06,
      "text": "They show the same inhaler in stock. I wouldn't transfer it yet because ours should be ready first.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0040",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 296.83,
      "end_seconds": 303.74,
      "text": "Right. Yeah, yeah. Okay, yeah. We can, we can leave it there. Uh, let's... Yeah, unless you c- can't finish it then no, we can transfer it. That's good. Thank you.",
      "word_count": 34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0041",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 304.6,
      "end_seconds": 310.54,
      "text": "Okay. That's what I'll do. I added the travel note and your mobile number is set for the ready alert.",
      "word_count": 22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0042",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 311.52,
      "end_seconds": 314.41,
      "text": "Um, also, uh, can I, can I pay in the app before I get there?",
      "word_count": 15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0043",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 316.06,
      "end_seconds": 322.26,
      "text": "Uh, yeah. Once it moves to ready the app may offer pre-pay. If it doesn't you can just pay the fifteen dollar co-pay at pickup.",
      "word_count": 28,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0044",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 322.84,
      "end_seconds": 328.08,
      "text": "Okay. Thank you, thank you, thank you so much. I was worried the doctor never sent it so I was kinda freaking out.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0045",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 328.68,
      "end_seconds": 334.4,
      "text": "All good. No, no, we have it. Uh, the insurance issue is cleared. We're just waiting on the final pharmacy check.",
      "word_count": 22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.72,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0046",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 335.28,
      "end_seconds": 338.56,
      "text": "All right. Okay. Uh, I'll watch for the text and thanks for calling the insurance too.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0047",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 340.3,
      "end_seconds": 343.82,
      "text": "Uh, you're welcome, Miles. Call us by six forty-five if you haven't heard from us, okay?",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0048",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 344.44,
      "end_seconds": 347.44,
      "text": "Okay, I will. Thank you. Have a, have a great rest of your shift.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0049",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 348.06,
      "end_seconds": 349,
      "text": "You too. Bye-bye.",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0050",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 349.01,
      "end_seconds": 349.01,
      "text": "Bye-bye.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.0,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    }
  ],
